-# Removing a membership is the one hard delete on these screens: it cascades
-# through the badges, the purchases and the whole currency ledger. Nothing here
-# is recoverable, so the dialog counts what goes rather than saying "na pewno?".
- losses = student_removal_losses(sheet)

%h2#gh-kick-title.gh-h2 Usunąć studenta z grupy?
%p
  = "#{student.display_name} straci dostęp do grupy"
  i zniknie z list, rankingu i arkuszy ocen.

- if losses.any?
  %p.gh-warning-note{ role: 'alert' }
    %i.fa-solid.fa-triangle-exclamation{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
    %span
      = "Przepadną: #{gh_and_list(losses)}."
      Tego nie da się cofnąć.
- else
  %p.gh-explainer-note Ten student nie ma jeszcze odznak, przedmiotów ani historii waluty.

%p.gh-small
  Jeśli wróci do grupy, dostanie nowe konto uczestnika i zacznie od zera.

.gh-dialog-button-row
  -# Anuluj first and focused: the safe button is the one you land on. In the
  -# stacked dialog closing means going back to the edit dialog underneath,
  -# which is still open.
  - if @in_modal
    %button.gh-btn.gh-btn--secondary{ type: 'button', data: { action: 'dialog#close' }, autofocus: true }
      Anuluj
  - else
    = link_to 'Anuluj', story_group_student_path(@story_group, student), class: 'gh-btn gh-btn--secondary'

  = button_to 'Usuń z grupy', story_group_student_path(@story_group, student),
    method: :delete, class: 'gh-btn',
    form: { data: { turbo_frame: (@in_modal ? 'modal2' : nil) } }
